# Mobile Sales Data Dashboard using Power BI

## Project Overview
This project presents an interactive Mobile Sales Dashboard built using Microsoft Power BI. It helps analyze sales performance, customer behavior, and business trends.

## Tools & Technologies
- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Microsoft Excel

## Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
- Total Sales
- Total Quantity Sold
- Total Transactions
- Average Sales

## Key Insights
- Monthly sales trends
- Brand-wise sales performance
- Mobile model-wise analysis
- Customer purchasing behavior
- Payment method analysis
- City-wise sales performance

## Files Included
- Details.xlsx
- Orders.xlsx
- Power BI Dashboard (.pbix)
- Dashboard Screenshots
- Supporting Images

## Objective
To transform raw mobile sales data into meaningful business insights through interactive dashboards and data visualization.

